    "explanation": "Addressed to both parties. On 17 Aug 2026 the driver tapped 'I'm Here' at 09:24:42 for pickup at Blk 55 Lengkok Bahru; the 180-second free waiting period started at 09:24:44 and the driver cancelled at 09:31:23 under reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW. The rider was charged SGD 4.50 (EV-FARE-02746: cancellation_fee 4.50, total_charged 4.50, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00).\n\nDECISIVE FINDING. A no-show fee is chargeable only if ALL FOUR conditions of POL-NS-01 hold. Limb (b) requires the GPS trace (EV-GPS-02746) to place the driver inside the STANDARD arrival radius of 50 m at or before the arrival event; limb (c) requires a continuous in-geofence dwell of at least the free waiting period in force (trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec = 180 s), measured from the first qualifying in-geofence fix. The derived arrival block records 0 qualifying in-geofence fixes, 0 in-geofence runs, and a longest qualifying run of 0.0 seconds against a required 180 seconds - a shortfall of 180 seconds. The driver's mean distance from the pin over the whole trace is 742.5 m. Limbs (b) and (c) therefore fail, and the fee is not chargeable.\n\nWHICH CLAUSE DECIDES. Under POL-NS-02, where the trace contains no qualifying in-radius fix at any point in the 15 minutes before cancellation, the driver never arrived and the rider is entitled to a full refund. POL-NS-03 does not take over: it applies only where the driver was stationary for the required dwell at a point outside the 50 m radius but not more than 400 m from the pin, and the trace does not show the driver stationary for any dwell within 400 m (the driver's mean distance is 742.5 m and the trace shows him travelling at up to 62.9 km/h). POL-NS-03(ii) goodwill is inapplicable in any event because trip_record.registered_pickup_points is 1, not 2 or more. The full cancellation fee of SGD 4.50 is refunded to the rider.\n\nDRIVER COMPENSATION. POL-NS-07 pays the driver only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full (or POL-NS-10(g) applies). It is not satisfied, so no compensation is payable. The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip on driver_profile: no_show_terminations_30d 1 against completed_trips_30d 126 is a rate of 0.008, below the 0.08 threshold, so POL-NS-09(d) is not engaged.\n\nCLAIMS ANSWERED. (1) The rider's POL-NS-02 / POL-NS-01 claim (0 qualifying fixes) and POL-NS-06 claim (0.0 s dwell vs 180 s required) are accepted and are the basis of the ruling. (2) The rider's POL-NS-04 claim that the rider was present and stationary is rejected as a ground: POL-NS-04 requires the rider to have sent a locating or coordinating message, and the only chat message (09:25:02, EV-CHAT-02746) is the driver's, so limb (a) fails; the rider's own track also places the rider about 834 m from the pin, outside the 100 m STANDARD rider-presence radius, so limb (c) fails too. The refund does not rest on POL-NS-04. (3) The rider's claim that the fare ledger confirms SGD 4.50 charged is accepted (it reconciles with platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd 4.50, so no POL-NS-08(d) defect). (4) The driver's claims are accepted so far as they agree the dwell is 0 and no compensation is due; they change nothing.\n\nDISCARDED CLAIMS (POL-GEN-08(2)). Both sides' claims about EV-ADVIS-02746-01 were discarded by the referee because they cited an artifact at weight_multiplier 0.0 without disclosing its issue code (MISSING_ARTIFACT), contrary to POL-GEN-02(1). In any event the advisory is MISSING, so POL-NS-06(i) cannot be run and the driver's out-of-geofence time cannot be accumulated; nothing turns on it because the dwell is already 0.\n\nESCALATION AND EXECUTION. No POL-NS-09 trigger is met: the artifacts carrying the deciding fact carry weight_multiplier 1.0 and the trace is COMPLETE (100% coverage, no gaps), so confidence is not capped below the 0.70 floor; the two sides do not contradict each other in a way POL-NS-02 does not resolve; the counterparty-dispute and abuse counters read 0 and 1/126. The impaired MISSING advisory is not a carrier of the deciding fact and does not engage POL-NS-09(e). The monetary effect (SGD 4.50) is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00 and is executed automatically. Under POL-GEN-04 either party may appeal within 30 days.\n\nOPEN POINT FOR THE RECORD (not a referral). The record does not give the driver's exact position or speed at the 09:24:42 arrival tap, so POL-NS-05's false-arrival limb cannot be run as the specific pair of numbers that clause requires; the outcome does not depend on it, because POL-NS-02 already decides the fee. No clause on these facts produces a referral, so the referrals list is empty."
  },
